  contentsAnswer: A camera stabilizer with a battery fitted, wrapped in pads.
  weightAnswer: Just under nine kilos including the suitcase.
  metalAnswer: The metal frame, camera and battery account for a moderate reading.
  packingAnswer: The rig is powered. I forgot the transport lock, so it tries to
    stay centered.
  responseAnswer: It can correct against a tilt and move after a short delay. I should
    have turned it off.
  authorReasoning: Innocent powered counterbalance. Mass and metal agree; the guest
    admits power and unlocked mechanism. Counter-motion alone is not conclusive.
